  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "He never fired a shot. What he supplied was rarer: a cover story."
    },
    {
      "text": "It began with two boys at a military school in Punjab."
    },
    {
      "text": "One ran an immigration business. The other used its Mumbai office to scout targets."
    },
    {
      "text": "An American jury: not guilty of Mumbai. Guilty of supporting the group behind it."
    },
    {
      "text": "Same events. Different crimes. And that gap brought him to Delhi."
    },
    {
      "text": "The Front Man. Now on The Sisodia Files."
    }
  ],
